Feature: Purgo Playground Schema Validation

  Background:
    Given the Unity Catalog Schema "purgo_playground" exists
    And sample sales data is available as input

  Scenario Outline: Successful Data Ingestion into Schema
    Given the sales data "<country_cd>", "<product_id>", <qty_sold>, "<sales_date>"
    When the data is ingested into schema "purgo_playground"
    Then the data should be correctly stored in the schema
    And the format should be validated for "<country_cd>", "<product_id>" identifiers
    And the records should reflect accurate "<qty_sold>"
    And the sales_date should be in YYYY-MM-DD format
    
    Examples:
      | country_cd | product_id | qty_sold | sales_date  |
      | US         | P1001      | 50       | 2024-01-15  |
      | CA         | P1001      | 40       | 2024-01-15  |

  Scenario: Error on Incorrect Data Format
    Given the sales data "US", "P1001", "50", "15-01-2024" (incorrect date format)
    When the data is ingested into schema "purgo_playground"
    Then an error should occur with message "Invalid date format, expected YYYY-MM-DD"

  Scenario: Handling Missing Data
    Given the sales data "US", "P1001", (missing qty_sold), "2024-01-15"
    When the data is ingested into schema "purgo_playground"
    Then an error should occur with message "Missing quantity sold information"

  Scenario: Access Control Validation
    Given a user with the role "<role>"
    When the user tries to access the schema "purgo_playground"
    Then access should be "<access_permission>"

    Examples:
      | role        | access_permission |
      | admin       | granted           |
      | analyst     | granted           |
      | viewer      | granted           |
      | guest       | denied            |

  Scenario: Data Integrity and Consistency Check
    Given the sales data is ingested into "purgo_playground"
    When a query aggregates sales qty_sold by product_id
    Then the sum for product_id "P1001" should match the expected total <expected_qty_total>
    
    Examples:
      | product_id | expected_qty_total |
      | P1001      | 150                |
      | P1002      | 68                 |

  Scenario: Update Frequency Validation
    Given the sales data is updated weekly
    When new sales data arrives for the week
    Then the schema "purgo_playground" should reflect the updated data within 24 hours

